# Persona (Moshi) – optional handoff to call-agent
# When set, Persona POSTs multipart (audio=conversation.wav stereo, optional phone, optional call_id) on hang-up.
# Run call-agent separately and set this to its /handoff endpoint, e.g.:
#   HANDOFF_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/handoff
# Optional: must match call-agent HANDOFF_SHARED_SECRET (sent as x-handoff-secret).
# Pass caller phone on the PersonaPlex WebSocket query when the UI or telephony layer has it.
# HANDOFF_URL=
# HANDOFF_SHARED_SECRET=
